   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.9#p1-d6a59609",
     "text": "The third son of Kohath, Ex 6:18.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "Hebron",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Ex 6:18",
       "ref": "EXO.6.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.12",
   "range": "1CH.15.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0ab47ab4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.12#p1-0ab47ab4",
     "text": "Prepare yourselves and be pure, abstain from all things by which you might be polluted, and so not able to come to the tabernacle.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "sanctify yourselves"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.13",
   "range": "1CH.15.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1cf8671c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.13#p1-1cf8671c",
     "text": "According as he has appointed in the law.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "order"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.16",
   "range": "1CH.15.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "58dd51a0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.16#p1-58dd51a0",
     "text": "These instruments and other ceremonies which they observed, were instructions of their infancy, which continued to the coming of Christ.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "instruments of musick"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.18",
   "range": "1CH.15.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3e89c6a2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.18#p1-3e89c6a2",
     "text": "Which were inferior in dignity.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "second degree"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.20",
   "range": "1CH.15.20",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "66dae3e4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.20#p1-66dae3e4",
     "text": "This was an instrument of music or a certain tune, to which they sang psalms.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "Alamoth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.21",
   "range": "1CH.15.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7449c332",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.21#p1-7449c332",
     "text": "Which was the eighth tune, over which he that was most excellent had charge.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "Sheminith to excel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.22",
   "range": "1CH.15.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "1256c488",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1CH.15.22#p1-1256c488",
     "text": "That is, to appoint Psalms and songs to them that sang.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "was for song"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1CH.15.24",
